# W268 v2.2.47 · E8 安全深化 · Netlify/Cloudflare 风格 HTTP 安全头配置
# 文档：https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/platform/headers/
#       https://docs.netlify.com/routing/headers/
#
# 必备 5 安全头（security_scan.py W268 · scan_headers 校验）：
#   1. Content-Security-Policy      防止 XSS/数据注入
#   2. X-Frame-Options              防止点击劫持（Clickjacking）
#   3. X-Content-Type-Options       防止 MIME 类型嗅探
#   4. Referrer-Policy              控制 Referer 泄露
#   5. Permissions-Policy           限制浏览器功能（摄像头/麦克风/定位）

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' cdn.jsdelivr.net; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' cdn.jsdelivr.net; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self' cdn.jsdelivr.net; connect-src 'self' https://api.github.com; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
